Equipment:
'''Equipment''' is a wearable type of item that typically provides stats and [[Perks]] to your character in Voxlblade.

Equipment can be obtained through a variety of sources, be that buying it from shops, killing [[Mobs]], [[Crafting]], or rewards from [[Dungeons]] and quests.

While able to be worn, equipment can also be infused into your character, innately providing their bonuses. See the [[Infusion]] page for more details.

Some equipment provides no bonuses to your character, and are intended to be used for vanity, for a list of these equipment, see the [[Cosmetics]] page.
